// The program of checks-list.alg with unread on. The list is gone into,
// which tells the function in it as one nothing calls, and the shipped
// checks go into that for every argument (uncalled on): its false claim
// is refuted, and the check ends the launch.
capability output
handlers = [(n) => claim(1 == 2)]
output.write("hello")
// phases: check
// check: unread = on
// end: refuted: a claim that is not true
// broader claim at: 6:20 refuted
